  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "An ethereal spirit, lingering on this plane of existence, draws
    its sustenance from the life energy of those nearby. \nShe is a vessel of the
    moon, a lunar princess who, just like the others, never fully became the moon\u2019s
    incarnation. \nTherefore, she remains trapped, on a never ending torment between
    life and death."
